      "order": 2,
      "text": "For regulation 4.12.2, the following shall be substituted: '4.12.2 Storm Water Drain (Rajakaluve) Buffers: Every storm water drain in the Bengaluru Metropolitan Region shall maintain a no-construction buffer zone of 30 metres for Primary (Rajakaluve) drains, 15 metres for Secondary drains, and 10 metres for Tertiary drains measured from the outer edge of the drain wall.'",
